The Project comprises:

Component 1: Replacing not less than 129,000 existing lamps with light-emitting diode (“LED”) technology in the public lighting system;

Component 2: Building a solar photovoltaic plant with a generation capacity of not less than 100MW;

Component 3: Project preparation and management. NOTE: Project has been split into two to reflect the two different components with the total amount split between each

